  <RoyalTitleDef ParentName="BaseNephilimEmpireTitle">
    <defName>NephilimCourtesan</defName>
    <label>nephilim courtesan</label>
    <description>The Nephilim title of freeholder gives a courtesan of the nephilim faction the right to own productive private property.\n\nFor the nephilim, most courtesans own no more than a tiny shop or taxi, but some can become very wealthy as merchants, entrepreneurs, or investors.</description>
