  <RoyalTitleDef ParentName="BaseNephilimTitlePsycaster">
    <defName>NephilimSupplicant</defName>
    <label>nephilim supplicant</label>
    <description>The Nephilim title of supplicant is held by those who serve the nephilim court in an important, specific way. While it is not a noble title and offers no economic rights beyond those of a courtesan, it does give the holder the right to use low-level psychic abilities.\n\nIn Nephilim dominated space, this title is often held by Maidens and non-nephilim sympathizers who have proven their worth.</description>
    <seniority>105</seniority>
    <favorCost>6</favorCost>
    <changeHeirQuestPoints>1200</changeHeirQuestPoints>
    <recruitmentResistanceOffset>10</recruitmentResistanceOffset> 
	<commonality>1</commonality>
	<maxPsylinkLevel>1</maxPsylinkLevel>
  </RoyalTitleDef>

