  <RoyalTitleDef ParentName="BaseNephilimTitlePsycaster">
    <defName>NephilimGardenTender</defName>
    <label>nephilim garden tender</label>
    <description>The Nephilim title of garden tender is a bridge between the service-oriented lower titles below and the power-holding nobility above.\n\nIn the Nephilim Empire, garden tenders usually hold high ranking titles in a Nephilim Garden's ruling council, either executing the will of a presiding Grand Matron or tending to local issues themselves should a Grand Matron not yet exist. At war, they take authority over the smallest combat units that fight independently. On the ground, a garden tender will lead a troop cohort. In the fleet, a garden tender will captain a destroyer or a combat group. This class is typically filled with Matrons and Queen's Guard, though exceptional Handmaidens and non-Nephilim have been known to rise up the ranks.</description>
