    <defName>NephilimBaroness</defName>
    <label>nephilim baroness</label>
    <labelFemale>nephilim baroness</labelFemale>
    <description>The Nephilim title of barones is the lowest of the middle nobility. While lower titles focus on personal service at war or commerce under a lord, baronesses hold title as semi-independent rulers. Each baroness is subordinate to their liege lord, but their obligations are mostly in supplying wealth and troops, and not in personal service.\n\nIn the Nephilim Empire, a baroness will typically own a city sector, mining colony, or similar outfit. At wartime, a baroness may captain a capital ship in name, or control a regiment of troops. \n\nIn keeping with the largely matriarchal power structures within the Nephilim empire, Baronesses are assumed to have a feminine gender, though male baronesses--incredible non-nephilim of considerable ability--do exist.</description>
